# proto-message: nexteggapp.taxprotos.common.v1.FormMapping
#
# What the SC1040 calls each concept, per tax year.
#
# Lines come from the 2025 SC1040 as the South Carolina Department of Revenue
# publishes it. There are no amount codes: IRS Publication 1220 covers the
# information returns the IRS receives electronically, and a state return is not
# one of them.
#
# The additions and subtractions are lettered a to w, between numbered lines 1
# to 4; the letters are mapped as printed.

